  "description": "Martin Property Consultants are delighted to present this well-located two-bedroom apartment in the popular Hybreasal development, Dublin 8.\n\nThe property comprises a bright and comfortable living area, a fitted kitchen with ample storage and workspace, two well-proportioned bedrooms, and a main bathroom. The apartment offers well-balanced accommodation and would suit anyone looking for a convenient home close to Dublin City Centre.\n\nHybreasal is ideally located within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants and recreational facilities. The property also benefits from excellent access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, with a range of public transport options available nearby.\n\nThe Liberties, Kilmainham, Rialto and Dublin 8 are all within easy reach, while the city centre is only a short commute away.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the location and accommodation on offer.\n\nPleasure send a message to enquire. ",
